// Scratchspace-backed sorts — query OWNED by scratchspace_lib (gathered via
// `[package.metadata.array_vis_bench] query = "scratchspace.avbs"`).
//
// The nightmare sort fans over its `backing` slot (3 Scratchspace backings). The
// scratchspace WORKFLOW kinds don't need a query here — spec_catalog's
// `Scratchspaces: ScratchspaceAlg<_>` in kinds.avbs already enumerates every
// ScratchspaceKind (the workflows) × their backing slot.

Nightmares: SortingAlgorithm = SortingAlgorithm<ScratchspaceMergeSort<backing = _>>
